    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player is a world-renowned investigator invited to the Cyan Sigillaria Circus that is being sabotaged from within by one of eleven headlining performers. You will converse with performers at length, learn their deepest secrets and fears. This circus is set in a world imbued with wholesome wonder, strange creatures, and colorful performers. The dialogue system keeps track of your choices and you will need to choose wisely to uncover the reasons for sabotage as there is no rollback on your choices.\u00a0<br><br><strong>One thing of note is that this game was designed to be beaten in one sitting so depending on your choices the game might conclude within an hour.</strong></p>",
